{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2014-common-biology-28","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2014,"subject":"biology","number":28,"points":1.5,"unitId":"neuro","unitLabel":"신경·근육·감각","topic":"뉴런·막전위·축삭","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["neuro","signaling","cell"],"stem":"다음은 쥐 해마 뇌절편의 장기강화(long-term potentiation)에 \n대한 설명이다.\n◦해마 CA3 뉴런의 축삭에 다음의\n순서대로 동일한 세기의 자극을 \n주면서 t1, t2, t3 시점에서 CA1 \n뉴런의 막전위를 측정한다.\nⅠ: 20분 동안 0.03 Hz 자극\nⅡ: 1초 동안 100 Hz 강축자극\nⅢ: 60분 동안 0.03 Hz 자극\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n[1.5점]\n<보 기>\nㄱ. 강축자극에 의해 시냅스후세포의 NMDA 수용체가 활성화된다.\nㄴ. 강축자극으로 시냅스후세포의 수상돌기에서 세포 내(cytosol)의\n칼슘 농도가 증가한다.\nㄷ. t1보다 t3에서 시냅스후세포막에 글루탐산 수용체가 많다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t019"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t020"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t021"]}],"answer":5,"acceptedAnswers":[5],"answerStatus":"source-text","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":776,"height":755,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,47.703,310.4,302.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-common-biology-28/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":776,"height":230,"region":0,"bbox":[14.28,405.703,310.4,92.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t012","t013","t014","t015","t016"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2014-common-biology-28/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":15,"sourceRect":[430.12,152.297,759.1,681.022],"width":328.98,"height":528.725,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[14.28,47.703,310.4,302.0],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.28,405.703,310.4,92.0],"section":"stem